# Native Settings (task 014 P2a, APPLAUNCH_SETTINGS_UI=native): the existing Settings tree full screen on the
# native display in the roller look, opened from its tile, then by keyboard: the Screen section (Brightness slider,
# DarkTime with its value), the DarkTime choice list, and the Brightness slider one step darker (on the Pi 3A+,
# whose backlight is on / off, the Brightness choice list instead).
# Review only: 640x480 and 480x320 keep the compat Settings goldens (settings.scene); these shots have their own
# names and no golden. Every header is checked against the home grid's (run.sh header: status strip pixel-identical,
# title at the same origin).
title settings native
review
env APPLAUNCH_SETTINGS_UI native
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
config dark_time 60
home
header home ZERO
launch Settings
shot settings_native_root
header settings_native_root Settings
key ENTER
shot settings_native_screen
header settings_native_screen "Settings > Screen" Screen
key DOWN
key ENTER
shot settings_native_darktime
header settings_native_darktime "Settings > Screen > DarkTime" "Screen > DarkTime" DarkTime
key ESC
key UP
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 key LEFT
@480x320 key ENTER
wait 300
shot settings_native_brightness
header settings_native_brightness "Settings > Screen" Screen "Settings > Screen > Brightness" "Screen > Brightness" Brightness
